# Non-small cell lung cancer Boolean network, corrected value-based KEGG reconstruction
# Missing-interaction entries (-/-) were excluded and do not define regulatory dependencies.
# Convention retained: --> and ..> positive; --| negative; +p inherits the accompanying sign.
